    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115987" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψωθίον</span></b> , τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψώω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>small crumb, morsel,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
				81
			</span></i> (acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				14.646c
			</span></i>):—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψωθία</span></b> , ἡ, <i>blister on
				under-surface of loaf,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				7.23
			</span></i>; hence of coin used in Hades, <i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
			</span></i> l. c. (acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				9.83
			</span></i>).</div>
